<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns secondary credits.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns secondary credits.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Banco de Mexico has</p>
<p>completed its credit auctions in the secondary market, dealers</p>
<p>said.</p>
<p>CREDIT AUCTIONS   TERM     AVERAGE</p>
<p>1.295  bln pesos  14 days  24.73 1.294  bln pesos   2 days  24.17</p>
<p>1.000  bln pesos   1 day   24.17</p>
<p>- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500</p>
</text>
